message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Shramko Asystent Urzędnika: open brief and reference design for an AI assistant for Polish public offices (access-to-public-information requests and pre-filled official forms)"
abstract: "Research, requirements, architecture, work packages and a multi-agent build playbook for an assistant that helps clerks of a Polish city office analyse access-to-public-information requests (UDIP) and draft answers, and that pre-fills official forms from data a visitor enters once. Prepared for the HackNation 2026 challenge 'Inteligentny asystent urzędnika' by Miasto Bydgoszcz. Includes a machine-readable catalogue of forms of Urząd Miasta Bydgoszczy."
